uot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;1&lt;br&gt;R Package for the Hierarchical Taxonomy of Psychopathology society&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Other Repositories (Pinned)&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/circumplex&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;circumplex&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;16 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;8&lt;br&gt;R Package for the Analysis and Visualization of Circumplex Data&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/ackwards&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ackwards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;9 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0&lt;br&gt;R Functions for Hierarchical Factor Structure Development&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/quarto-index&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;quarto-index&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;4 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0&lt;br&gt;A Quarto extension for adding indexes to book formats&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/tidymodels/nestedtune&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;nestedtune&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;2 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;1&lt;br&gt;Nested cross-validation for the tidymodels ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/intraclass&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;intraclass&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0&lt;br&gt;Modern intraclass correlation coefficients (ICCs) via generalizability theory and mixed-model variance-component estimation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Hi there, I&#39;m Jeffrey Girard!&lt;/h3&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Associate Professor of Psychology at &lt;a href=&quot;https://psych.ku.edu&quot;&gt;University of Kansas&lt;/a&gt;, where I direct a &lt;a href=&quot;https://affcom.ku.edu&quot;&gt;computational social science research lab&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Co-Founder of &lt;a href=&quot;https://smart-workshops.com&quot;&gt;SMaRT Workshops&lt;/a&gt;, which provides online training workshops for statistics, methods, and research training.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Principal Scientist at &lt;a href=&quot;https://fluidconcepts.ai&quot;&gt;Fluid Concepts Research&lt;/a&gt;, a data lab focused on solving hard problems in Human--AI Interaction.&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Open Courses:&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://stats.jmgirard.com&quot;&gt;Statistical Methods in R&lt;/a&gt; - A mostly-done (12/15 chapters) graduate course in applied statistics.&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Statistics Software:&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/ackwards&quot;&gt;ackwards&lt;/a&gt; - A &lt;strong&gt;stable&lt;/strong&gt; R package for hierarchical structure (bass-ackwards) analysis.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://circumplex.jmgirard.com/&quot;&gt;circumplex&lt;/a&gt; - A &lt;strong&gt;stable&lt;/strong&gt; R package for analyzing and visualizing circular data.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/intraclass&quot;&gt;intraclass&lt;/a&gt; - A &lt;strong&gt;stable&lt;/strong&gt; R package for calculating intraclass correlations (ICCs).&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/bsync&quot;&gt;bsync&lt;/a&gt; - An &lt;em&gt;experimental&lt;/em&gt; R package for conducting behavioral synchrony analyses.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/tidymodels/nestedtune&quot;&gt;nestedtune&lt;/a&gt; - An &lt;em&gt;experimental&lt;/em&gt; R package for nested cross-validation in tidymodels.&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Research Software:&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/easystats/datawizard&quot;&gt;datawizard&lt;/a&gt; - A &lt;strong&gt;stable&lt;/strong&gt; R package for data wrangling and statistical transformation.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/rlmstudio&quot;&gt;rlmstudio&lt;/a&gt; - A &lt;strong&gt;stable&lt;/strong&gt; R package for accessing and controlling local AI models using LM Studio.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/tidymedia&quot;&gt;tidymedia&lt;/a&gt; - An &lt;strong&gt;stable&lt;/strong&gt; R package for working with audio, video, and image files.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://zotdex.jmgirard.com&quot;&gt;Zotdex&lt;/a&gt; - A web-based index of Zotero plugins for discoverability and version support tracking.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/openac&quot;&gt;openac&lt;/a&gt; - An &lt;em&gt;experimental&lt;/em&gt; R package for automating common affective computing tasks.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/facs&quot;&gt;facs&lt;/a&gt; - An &lt;em&gt;experimental&lt;/em&gt; R package for working with Facial Action Coding System (FACS) data.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/hitop&quot;&gt;hitop&lt;/a&gt; - An &lt;em&gt;experimental&lt;/em&gt; R package for working with Hierarchical Taxonomy of Psychopathology (HiTOP) data.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://carma.jmgirard.com&quot;&gt;CARMA&lt;/a&gt; - An archived software for collecting continuous media annotations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://darma.jmgirard.com&quot;&gt;DARMA&lt;/a&gt; - An archived software for collecting continuous two-dimensional media annotations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Quarto Extensions&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/lordicon&quot;&gt;lordicon&lt;/a&gt; - A &lt;strong&gt;stable&lt;/strong&gt; Quarto extension for embedding animated &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.lordicon.com/icons&quot;&gt;Lordicon&lt;/a&gt; icons in HTML.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/embedpdf&quot;&gt;embedpdf&lt;/a&gt; - A &lt;strong&gt;stable&lt;/strong&gt; Quarto extension for embedding PDF files in HTML with mobile support.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/quarto-index&quot;&gt;quarto-index&lt;/a&gt; - An &lt;em&gt;experimental&lt;/em&gt; Quarto extension for creating indexes in Quarto books.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/wrapped&quot;&gt;wrapped&lt;/a&gt; - An &lt;em&gt;experimental&lt;/em&gt; Quarto extension for wrapping text around images and tables.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/honeypot&quot;&gt;honeypot&lt;/a&gt; - An archived Quarto extension for detecting LLM cheating on HTML assignments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/details&quot;&gt;details&lt;/a&gt; - An archived Quarto extension for embedding interactive details blocks in HTML documents.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Docker Images:&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/rstudio2u&quot;&gt;rstudio2u&lt;/a&gt; - A multiarchitecture (amd64/arm64) image combining rstudio and r2u.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/r2u-ssh&quot;&gt;r2u-ssh&lt;/a&gt; - A multiarchitecture (amd/arm64) image for accessing r2u from Positron with SSH .&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/rocker-bayes&quot;&gt;rocker-bayes&lt;/a&gt; - A multiarchitecture (amd64/arm64) image for Bayesian analysis in R.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jmgirard/audio-whisper&quot;&gt;audio-whisper&lt;/a&gt; - A WSL (amd64) image for AI transcription from R with CUDA-support.&lt;/li&gt; 
